# Thalweg commits to `staging`. `main` is production: it is the Cloudflare Pages
# production branch, so a commit landing there is a commit landing on the address
# the owner opens. Promotion is a merge, said out loud.
#
# THIS REPO RAN ON `main` ALONE UNTIL 2026-08-29, and the reason it did has
# expired. It was three days old, not deployed and not linked from anywhere —
# there was nothing for a staging gate to protect and one branch was less to
# carry. It is now live at cv-thalweg.pages.dev and on the hub's front page.
#
# It is also the app in the family that needs the on-device pass MOST rather
# than least: it is read one-handed on a riverbank, and every defect this repo
# found in its first week was one that only appears on the real device — a
# first-run panel opening at its own last line, readings squeezed to 22px with
# a keyboard up. None of those is visible from a desktop browser or a test.
# Checks that run on EVERY commit here, including a promote, because they are
# about WHAT is being committed rather than where. The patch notes are the one
# thing in this app that a passing test suite cannot protect: a release can be
# perfect and still reach a reader as an update that will not say what it did.
#
# And a count typed into reader-facing copy is the same kind of defect: correct
# on the day it was written, silently wrong the moment the array behind it
# grows, and invisible to every test that only asks whether the app renders.
also=tools/notes-check.mjs
also=tools/copy-count.mjs
#
# And the hub commit is written in two files here — the marker this repo has
# reconciled with, and the pin CI checks the hub out at to run the shared
# gates. They are the same fact and they drift silently, and when they do the
# shared gates go green while running rules this repo has already adopted and
# they have never heard of. Copied from solve-ent, which is the only sibling
# that had it; it is repo-local ON PURPOSE, because a gate validating the pin
# cannot itself be fetched at that pin. (Hub LESSONS §117.)
also=tools/hub-pin-check.mjs

work=staging
promote=main
escape=THALWEG_PROMOTE
